{"articleNo":"550645","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=550645&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 「2026 공공기관 채용정보박람회」 장애인 채용상담부스 운영 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2026.01.19","hit":"5029","attachments":[{"name":"붙임 1. 2026 공공기관 채용정보박람회 안내문.hwpx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=550645&attachNo=160596"},{"name":"붙임 2. 2026 공공기관 채용정보박람회 포스터.png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=550645&attachNo=160597"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:17.6pt;margin-right:5.0pt;text-indent:-17.6pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">재정경제부가 주최하는</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2026 </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">공공기관 채용정보박람회</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">」</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">에서 한국장애인고용공단이 장애인 구직 상담 및 채용정보 등을 제공하기 위해</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:17.6pt;margin-right:5.0pt;text-indent:-17.6pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:바탕체;mso-fareast-font-family:바탕체;font-size:12.0pt;\"></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">장애인 채용상담 부스 및 취업지원 컨설팅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">'</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">을 아래와 같이 운영하오니 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:17.6pt;margin-right:5.0pt;text-indent:-17.6pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font face=\"바탕체\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><u>※ 상세 내용 [붙임1] 참조</u></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:17.6pt;margin-right:5.0pt;text-indent:-17.6pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font face=\"바탕체\"><br></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">가. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">박람회 개요</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">행사일정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2026. 1. 27.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 29.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) 10:00~18:00</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">행사장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">서울 양재 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">at</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">센터 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1,2</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">전시장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">세계로룸 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">a,b(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">서울</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">양재동 소재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:바탕체;font-family:바탕체;mso-ascii-font-family:바탕체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">행사 내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">장애인 채용상담 부스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">장애대학생 진로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">취업 상담</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">장애인 구직상담 및 취업지원 프로그램 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">장애인 보조공학기기 전시 및 체험</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">서류 및 면접 코칭 등 장애인 구직자 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1:1 </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">취업컨설팅</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">5) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">공공기관별 장애인 전용 채용상담 운영용상담 부스 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:바탕체;mso-fareast-font-family:바탕체;font-size:12.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">참가방법</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ~‘26. 1. 26.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">까지 사전등록</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:115.0pt;margin-right:5.0pt;text-indent:-115.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(www.publicjob.kr) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">우측상단 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">회원가입</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">' </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">시 자동으로 사전등록 완료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">박람회 당일 현장 등록 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:17.6pt;margin-rig